WEBVTT

00:02.731 --> 00:05.442
I won't let you die on me, Rohan,
hang in there!

00:07.194 --> 00:09.446
So it picked up on my scent, huh?

00:09.613 --> 00:11.239
So it's gonna hunt me down,

00:11.282 --> 00:12.449
and feed on my body's nutrients

00:12.533 --> 00:14.159
the moment it gets
its creepy feet on me, huh?

00:16.245 --> 00:17.246
I got it!

00:17.288 --> 00:19.790
It can't travel faster than 60km/h!

00:19.915 --> 00:22.709
This bike'll be able to
outpace him easy.

00:22.877 --> 00:27.377
But finding the user…
how the hell am I going to do that?

00:27.840 --> 00:30.551
Okay, first things first,
I gotta think about this logically.

00:31.177 --> 00:33.304
To start, why'd he lay his trap

00:33.345 --> 00:35.180
in the inside of a tunnel
of all places?

00:35.598 --> 00:36.682
You'd think ambushing us

00:36.765 --> 00:38.641
from the side of the road
would be easier.

00:39.518 --> 00:42.145
Second, there must be more to
his nutrient feeding

00:42.188 --> 00:43.856
than meets the eye.

00:44.356 --> 00:46.691
There must be some significance
to the tunnel.

00:47.276 --> 00:49.278
I've gotta investigate!

00:49.486 --> 00:52.197
I've gotta dig up every piece
of info on that Futatsumori Tunnel!

00:52.781 --> 00:54.073
Koichi!

00:54.116 --> 00:57.994
I'll call Koichi and have him
use Reverb to find the user!

01:01.916 --> 01:02.791
Hey, hey.

01:02.833 --> 01:05.585
What's got you all riled up?
It's okay…

01:09.757 --> 01:13.177
There.
No way he's anywhere near me now.

01:13.260 --> 01:14.511
Where's that card?

01:19.016 --> 01:20.517
How the hell…?!

01:20.601 --> 01:22.603
How'd he just appear
out of thin air?

01:23.145 --> 01:27.023
I was driving at 80km/h,
his top speed is only 60km/h.

01:27.066 --> 01:28.650
A simple calculation tells you

01:28.692 --> 01:31.277
he should've arrived
two minutes after me.

01:33.072 --> 01:34.698
That thing is a Stand.

01:34.782 --> 01:37.201
It can disappear and reappear
wherever it wants…

01:37.243 --> 01:40.246
It figures out your rough location,

01:40.371 --> 01:42.289
then appears and…

01:42.456 --> 01:44.624
homes in for the kill by scent!

01:46.168 --> 01:48.128
S-Sixty kilometers…

01:50.381 --> 01:51.882
W-What?!

01:52.007 --> 01:53.550
- Shit! A baby carriage!
- What's wrong?

01:53.634 --> 01:54.843
You're in such a foul mood…

01:58.931 --> 02:00.891
If I slow down, I'm a dead man.

02:00.933 --> 02:02.267
Rohan won't make it either.

02:02.768 --> 02:04.895
Sorry, but hanging around
is a no go.

02:04.937 --> 02:06.521
I've gotta just gun it!

02:09.858 --> 02:12.193
All right Shining Diamond!

02:26.292 --> 02:27.334
Do your thing.

02:29.128 --> 02:30.129
Good!

02:37.845 --> 02:40.973
At this rate,
I'll never be able to call Koichi!

02:43.434 --> 02:45.102
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:45.811 --> 02:47.938
<i>(Listen up)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:48.689 --> 02:50.607
<i>(Listen)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

02:51.900 --> 02:54.944
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown
(3, 2, 1) Let's Go!</i>

02:55.029 --> 02:56.155
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

02:56.238 --> 03:00.738
<i>Shining Justice begins to sprout</i>

03:01.744 --> 03:06.244
<i>Brand-new bed town
Will we meet? Let's find out</i>

03:07.416 --> 03:11.916
<i>Feeling the sea breeze from the cape
through the tunnel to the tower</i>

03:13.047 --> 03:17.547
<i>We wander into the alley,
drawn to each other</i>

03:18.344 --> 03:22.844
<i>A shadow melts into our hearts</i>

03:25.726 --> 03:30.226
<i>But the golden spirits
shine a light to protect us</i>

03:35.611 --> 03:40.111
<i>Let the voice of love
take you higher</i>

03:40.616 --> 03:45.116
<i>Let the gathering forces
overcome time itself</i>

03:46.955 --> 03:51.455
<i>1999 Bizarre Summer</i>

03:51.877 --> 03:56.377
<i>Our courage keeps the town in bloom</i>

03:57.466 --> 04:01.636
<i>Great Days</i>

04:04.473 --> 04:08.727
EPISODE 29
HIGHWAY GO GO, PART 2

04:04.848 --> 04:05.890
<i>All right, Yoshioka.</i>

04:06.141 --> 04:07.350
<i>In exactly one minute,</i>

04:07.434 --> 04:08.748
<i>you will receive
an extremely important call.</i>

04:10.270 --> 04:12.188
<i>This deal's worth one billion yen!</i>

04:12.272 --> 04:14.023
<i>Failure is not an option!</i>

04:14.483 --> 04:15.775
<i>Don't disappoint me, Yoshioka!</i>

04:15.818 --> 04:20.197
I gotcha, Boss!
Just leave it to me.

04:20.489 --> 04:23.074
This'll work! Of course…
a cell phone!

04:23.158 --> 04:25.827
It showed up at the nick of time.
Lucky!

04:25.869 --> 04:27.245
I promise, sir,
I'll do everything in my power!

04:27.329 --> 04:29.080
- Guess I do have a guardian angel!
- Um, hello?

04:29.206 --> 04:29.956
Huh?

04:29.998 --> 04:32.709
Dammit! One billion yen!

04:32.876 --> 04:35.795
Shit, did I break it
when I grabbed it?

04:35.838 --> 04:37.506
Where the hell is
my guardian angel now!

04:37.548 --> 04:40.300
<i>If you hate me, then just hang up!</i>

04:40.342 --> 04:42.719
H-How could you say that, Mina yo?

04:42.803 --> 04:45.222
<i>Spit it out! Ask her to be your wife!</i>

04:46.181 --> 04:49.184
Mina yo, will you m-marry—

04:50.811 --> 04:53.396
So it is my lucky day.

04:53.439 --> 04:55.774
- Now that's what I call good timing!
<i>- Huh? What? What is it, Akira?</i>

05:06.118 --> 05:07.410
Hello, Hirose residence.

05:07.453 --> 05:08.454
<i>Koichi!</i>

05:11.665 --> 05:12.957
So that's the deal.

05:13.041 --> 05:15.334
If I don't find the user,
I'm toast.

05:15.752 --> 05:17.795
<i>The guy must be obsessed
with the tunnel.</i>

05:17.880 --> 05:20.799
<i>Like he has some kind of
grudge or something.</i>

05:20.883 --> 05:23.260
<i>Any incidents
involving that tunnel?</i>

05:23.886 --> 05:27.723
Th-There is. It was published
in the paper two days ago.

05:28.015 --> 05:30.726
I saw it on the news, too.

05:30.767 --> 05:33.019
Some biker guy was drunk driving,

05:33.061 --> 05:35.271
and crashed into
the tunnel's entrance.

05:35.314 --> 05:38.775
Supposedly he's unconscious
and covered in bruises.

05:38.817 --> 05:41.486
He's in intensive care
at Budogaoka Hospital now.

05:41.778 --> 05:44.405
Sounds like the Stand got him, too.

05:44.448 --> 05:45.490
Anything else?

05:45.657 --> 05:47.325
Give me a sec.

05:47.409 --> 05:50.412
I remember there was blood
all over the road.

05:50.454 --> 05:53.665
The Stand feeds on
people's nutrients, right?

05:53.749 --> 05:55.417
His victims would look different.

05:55.584 --> 05:57.335
Maybe this guy from
the motorcycle accident

05:57.419 --> 06:00.255
actually became the Stand user.

06:00.797 --> 06:04.634
<i>So he leeches nutrients
from others to heal himself..</i>

06:05.719 --> 06:08.012
What? I-It's the ocean!

06:09.264 --> 06:11.224
I'm headed straight for
the cold, dark deep!

06:11.266 --> 06:12.642
I gotta turn somewhere,

06:12.726 --> 06:14.144
or I'm gonna dive head first
into that water!

06:15.103 --> 06:16.437
That corner!

06:16.480 --> 06:19.149
- I have to keep it over 60km/h!
<i>- Hello? Josuke? What's wrong?</i>

06:19.316 --> 06:22.652
Koichi! Stay with me.
Don't hang up!

06:23.695 --> 06:25.988
This is it… shit!

06:28.116 --> 06:30.701
Crap! I think I'm gonna crash!

06:32.996 --> 06:33.830
No.

06:33.872 --> 06:35.540
If anyone can do it,
it's Josuke Higashikata.

06:35.624 --> 06:38.668
I can do this. I will do this!

06:42.673 --> 06:44.633
Yes! I made the turn!

06:44.675 --> 06:47.260
Didja see that?!
Screw you, asshole!

06:48.512 --> 06:50.180
W-What?!

06:50.264 --> 06:52.098
More ocean!

06:50.806 --> 06:52.182
NO ENTRY

06:52.140 --> 06:52.203
The Port of Morioh!

06:56.144 --> 06:58.646
Shining Diamond!

07:09.283 --> 07:10.742
See that broken wall…

07:10.826 --> 07:11.910
Fix it!

07:19.376 --> 07:20.919
Th-That was close…

07:21.128 --> 07:25.340
It was charging straight at me,
and was totally blind to the wall.

07:25.507 --> 07:27.091
Like a mosquito
that can't see a screen,

07:27.175 --> 07:29.135
it was pursuing me by scent alone.

07:29.845 --> 07:33.390
Its attacks aren't thought out
or premeditated.

07:33.473 --> 07:36.142
Its only objective is
to drain me of my nutrients.

07:36.935 --> 07:39.228
That theory about this guy
being from the accident

07:39.271 --> 07:40.730
is starting to make sense.

07:40.772 --> 07:42.231
The pieces are coming together.

07:42.566 --> 07:43.733
<i>Josuke!</i>

07:44.860 --> 07:46.403
Koichi, the guy at the hospital!

07:46.445 --> 07:48.864
That guy from the accident
has to be the Stand user!

07:48.905 --> 07:50.740
Find his name.

07:50.824 --> 07:51.825
<i>Got it.</i>

07:53.493 --> 07:56.787
Damn, this situation sucks…

07:56.872 --> 08:00.166
H-How am I gonna get out of this?

08:00.876 --> 08:05.130
Where did Josuke go?
That meddlesome little shit…

08:07.716 --> 08:10.051
I admit, when you took aim at

08:10.093 --> 08:13.429
that nearly dead punk biker
as your next pin cushion,

08:13.472 --> 08:16.600
You're crazy, crazy,
I thought, but…

08:16.683 --> 08:18.226
You're astonishing! Incredible!

08:18.268 --> 08:22.397
Who'd have thought that kid
would bring forth Highway Go Go?

08:22.439 --> 08:25.608
Stands really are a manifestation
of the soul…

08:25.692 --> 08:27.443
The hungrier their spirit,
the more intense their power!

08:27.486 --> 08:31.986
The insatiable hunger
to heal oneself is unstoppable.

08:32.574 --> 08:36.452
But oh how nice it would've been
to witness Josuke bite the dust!

08:48.882 --> 08:51.301
What do I do? What do I do?

09:09.611 --> 09:11.195
A ditch!

09:12.197 --> 09:15.283
Finding a ditch that empties
into the ocean helps,

09:15.325 --> 09:18.202
but he keeps closing in on me.

09:18.286 --> 09:20.746
H-How do I make my getaway?

09:23.417 --> 09:24.668
So, which one?

09:24.751 --> 09:28.838
Let's see… The ocean's behind me,
which means it's also to my right.

09:28.880 --> 09:30.339
I've gotta steer clear
of the water.

09:30.424 --> 09:32.843
I came from the left… I think.

09:37.305 --> 09:39.432
W-Which way do I go now?

09:39.474 --> 09:41.476
I feel like the ocean's
to the left,

09:41.518 --> 09:42.727
but if it's to the right…

09:42.811 --> 09:44.687
Th-There's the middle, too…

09:46.314 --> 09:47.690
W-What's happening?

09:49.151 --> 09:52.863
I'm gunning it,
but I'm slowing down…

09:53.488 --> 09:55.156
I-Is it busted?

09:58.034 --> 10:01.328
W-What?! It's working just fine.

10:01.371 --> 10:03.498
Then why can't I accelerate?

10:03.540 --> 10:05.124
I'm grinding to a halt!

10:05.667 --> 10:07.502
I-It's coming!

10:10.630 --> 10:11.839
Could it be…

10:15.802 --> 10:17.887
Am I out of gas?

10:18.013 --> 10:20.724
Man, you had me
freaking out there for a second.

10:20.766 --> 10:22.809
I'm just out of gas…

10:22.851 --> 10:25.436
That's no sweat at all.

10:25.520 --> 10:27.855
I was worried I had
a major wreck on my hands

10:27.898 --> 10:30.233
that even Shining Diamond
couldn't fix.

10:31.276 --> 10:32.819
Nope, I'm not stressing.

10:33.278 --> 10:35.863
I can get out of this, easy peasy.

10:41.453 --> 10:43.496
Still no problem.

10:54.966 --> 10:57.134
Little tweak here…

10:58.762 --> 11:01.097
A little modification there…

11:03.225 --> 11:04.434
Though that thing teleports,

11:04.518 --> 11:06.436
so I guess I can't get
too comfortable…

11:08.396 --> 11:10.272
The gasoline, however,
is taken care of.

11:10.357 --> 11:11.399
But…

11:11.441 --> 11:14.861
I guess there is
one little problem…

11:15.487 --> 11:17.947
Where the hell am I…

11:18.031 --> 11:20.908
How the hell do I get to
that freak in hospital?

11:25.831 --> 11:28.458
HIGHWAY GO GO

11:28.542 --> 11:32.629
BUDOGAOKA
GENERAL HOSPITAL

11:30.126 --> 11:32.650
Excuse me. I'm in a real pinch.

11:32.838 --> 11:35.966
I have to know how I can find

11:36.007 --> 11:38.300
the young man from
the Futatsumori Tunnel accident.

11:38.385 --> 11:39.803
What's his room number?

11:40.595 --> 11:42.138
You have to tell me!

11:43.723 --> 11:45.141
Listen little man…

11:45.267 --> 11:47.477
I suggest you read
that sign over there.

11:47.519 --> 11:50.021
VISITING HOURS HAVE CONCLUDED
FOR TODAY.

11:47.853 --> 11:48.854
Huh?

11:50.272 --> 11:54.067
If you need your eyes examined,
come back tomorrow morning at 9:30.

11:54.526 --> 11:56.986
Um, I'm not here for a visit.

11:57.070 --> 11:59.113
There's a reason
I need to know his name!

11:59.739 --> 12:01.866
This is serious.
You have to tell me!

12:02.075 --> 12:05.078
Perhaps you didn't understand.
I said go home.

12:05.412 --> 12:08.415
You know, it's pesky kids like you

12:08.456 --> 12:10.416
who really make life difficult
for us adults.

12:10.458 --> 12:13.586
You're pretty shrimpy for someone
belonging to a biker gang.

12:13.628 --> 12:16.088
Do your feet even reach the ground?

12:18.091 --> 12:19.425
Give me a break.

12:21.595 --> 12:22.804
Act 3…

12:23.388 --> 12:26.933
Okay, Master! Let's kill da ho!

12:27.100 --> 12:28.976
Beeetch!

12:32.314 --> 12:34.149
O-Oh, no!

12:35.150 --> 12:37.527
That was close…

12:37.777 --> 12:40.988
These are 50,000 yen a bottle.

12:41.615 --> 12:42.449
Huh?

12:42.490 --> 12:44.033
They're so heavy?!

12:44.826 --> 12:45.993
They're going to fall!

12:46.661 --> 12:50.665
Hey, you! Help me! Hold me up!

12:52.834 --> 12:56.754
That "Hey, you!"
wasn't meant for me, was it?

12:56.838 --> 12:59.632
Yes! You're the only one in here.

12:59.674 --> 13:01.217
I don't know how much longer
I can hold this…

13:01.843 --> 13:03.803
Well, that's all fine and good…

13:03.845 --> 13:06.556
You did just tell me to go home.

13:07.015 --> 13:10.059
I mean, I am shrimpy,
so I probably couldn't reach.

13:11.019 --> 13:15.519
Is your superior going to
reprimand you if those break?

13:15.857 --> 13:18.401
That would be sort of
an oh my god moment, wouldn't it?

13:18.610 --> 13:20.987
All right, fine! I'll tell you!

13:21.029 --> 13:22.405
He's in room 525!

13:22.489 --> 13:24.574
Yuya Fungami is in 525.

13:24.616 --> 13:26.909
Take that elevator
to the fifth floor!

13:27.827 --> 13:28.828
Huh?

13:31.831 --> 13:32.873
Josuke!

13:32.999 --> 13:34.208
Koichi…

13:35.377 --> 13:37.045
Figure it out, Koichi?

13:37.087 --> 13:40.256
Room 525! His name is Yuya Fungami!

13:40.340 --> 13:42.050
It's room 525!

13:42.092 --> 13:43.760
Thanks, Koichi!

13:45.887 --> 13:48.806
It's on the fifth floor!
Just take the elevator!

13:59.401 --> 14:01.444
Sh-Shit…

14:02.278 --> 14:04.905
He's slipping his way in!

14:08.910 --> 14:11.495
Koichi! Reverb Act 3!

14:14.541 --> 14:18.795
You're a man I can always count on.
Thanks, Koichi!

14:19.045 --> 14:23.132
But 3 Freeze can focus its attack
on only one place at a time.

14:23.216 --> 14:25.968
The rest of them
are going after Josuke!

14:34.227 --> 14:36.646
There it is! Room 525!

14:37.522 --> 14:39.482
I can't believe I made it!

14:41.943 --> 14:43.319
The vent!

14:49.784 --> 14:50.951
You bastard!

14:50.994 --> 14:53.246
Only a few meters left to the room…

14:53.913 --> 14:55.581
Why'd it have to be so far away!

14:55.623 --> 14:57.916
I'm gonna kick your ass,
if it kills me!

15:06.801 --> 15:08.302
So that's the bastard!

15:08.344 --> 15:10.637
I'm gonna get to that bed… I swear!

15:10.680 --> 15:12.598
I'm gonna get to that bed

15:12.640 --> 15:15.517
and kick your ass…

15:16.728 --> 15:19.021
Who the hell is this punk?

15:19.105 --> 15:21.232
You're in Yu's room!

15:21.316 --> 15:24.694
This isn't your room, idiot!

15:24.903 --> 15:27.030
Leave that loser alone.

15:27.906 --> 15:29.949
You don't look so hot…

15:30.033 --> 15:31.743
I thought it had been a while

15:31.826 --> 15:36.326
since that first guy in the tunnel
gave me his nutrients…

15:37.707 --> 15:41.210
So you're the second sap
I've been chasing around, huh?

15:41.336 --> 15:43.546
It's commendable
you made it this far.

15:43.630 --> 15:45.381
I'm kinda shocked, actually.

15:46.174 --> 15:48.801
Yu, you know this guy?

15:48.843 --> 15:49.927
Huh?

15:53.848 --> 15:57.726
Nope, never seen him in my life,
don't really care either.

16:01.898 --> 16:04.483
<i>Nice goin', Highway Go Go.</i>

16:04.526 --> 16:07.111
<i>I'm feeling a lot better already</i>

16:07.195 --> 16:11.240
<i>Now if I can just get a hold of two
or three more guys like this one,</i>

16:11.324 --> 16:13.534
<i>I'll be able to make
a full recovery</i>

16:13.743 --> 16:14.702
Hey!

16:14.744 --> 16:18.414
We told you, get your ass up
and get the hell out!

16:18.498 --> 16:21.584
And I told you to leave
that loser alone!

16:21.876 --> 16:25.880
Now get over here and
give me some love and attention.

16:26.673 --> 16:29.676
Remember, poor Yu over here
is still stuck in bed.

16:29.717 --> 16:33.470
I really have to pee. I don't know
how much longer I can hold it.

16:33.555 --> 16:35.807
Ooh! Time for me to get to work!

16:35.890 --> 16:38.434
We all agreed we'd be taking turns!

16:38.476 --> 16:40.102
I'm up now!

16:40.186 --> 16:42.188
What? No, it's me!

16:42.313 --> 16:44.440
It doesn't matter who does it.

16:44.524 --> 16:47.026
Just bring that piss bottle
and help me out.

16:47.068 --> 16:48.277
Okay!

16:48.570 --> 16:50.113
Then I'll…

16:52.031 --> 16:53.657
Hey, Akemi.

16:53.825 --> 16:55.743
That peach is rotten.

16:55.785 --> 16:57.369
Fix me another one.

16:57.662 --> 16:59.914
How do you know it's rotten?

16:59.956 --> 17:02.625
How? Take a whiff.

17:02.750 --> 17:04.626
Any idiot can tell it's rotten.

17:04.669 --> 17:06.128
From over there?

17:06.212 --> 17:07.838
You know, you have a point.

17:08.423 --> 17:11.134
My sense of smell
must have gotten better.

17:12.260 --> 17:15.137
Oh, you're right…
It really is rotten.

17:17.640 --> 17:20.726
One of you three
is on your period, right?

17:20.935 --> 17:23.312
Am I wrong? Someone's
on her period, right?

17:23.354 --> 17:24.188
Huh?

17:24.272 --> 17:26.649
Ha, so it's you, Yoshie!

17:27.692 --> 17:29.235
Hit the nail on the head.

17:29.277 --> 17:32.488
And one of you
is also really pissed, right?

17:33.781 --> 17:38.076
When agitated,
the body secretes adrenaline,

17:38.119 --> 17:39.745
and it's glaringly obvious
to my nose.

17:39.871 --> 17:42.373
What got under your skin…
Is it you, Reiko?

17:42.457 --> 17:45.626
Huh? I'm not angry or anything.

17:45.668 --> 17:49.171
We couldn't be happier
you're feeling better baby.

17:49.255 --> 17:51.507
Yeah, we're happy as a clam!

17:51.549 --> 17:53.634
Yeah, nobody here's mad at all.

17:53.843 --> 17:56.178
Hey, hey, something's wrong.

17:57.138 --> 18:00.850
Somebody's downright furious,
and I can smell it loud and clear.

18:02.101 --> 18:03.519
You better not be fibbing.

18:03.561 --> 18:06.605
Which one of you
is seething on the inside?

18:06.648 --> 18:07.690
You're looking at him.

18:09.692 --> 18:14.192
That full-bodied eau de adrenaline…
Is courtesy of yours truly!

18:14.489 --> 18:15.573
That's bullshit!

18:15.657 --> 18:18.076
Your body should be
a nutritional waste land by now!

18:18.159 --> 18:19.910
How are you standing?

18:20.036 --> 18:21.037
Because…

18:23.498 --> 18:26.584
You were sipping on my IV?

18:26.668 --> 18:28.586
It was just a sampling,

18:28.670 --> 18:31.255
but it was enough
to perk me up a bit.

18:35.385 --> 18:36.677
I want you to release Rohan, now.

18:36.719 --> 18:39.930
He's the guy you're
holding captive in the tunnel!

18:41.182 --> 18:42.308
Imbecile!

18:42.350 --> 18:46.354
Highway Go Go
hasn't forgotten your scent!

18:49.023 --> 18:50.065
Yu, baby!

18:50.149 --> 18:52.234
You three, keep your mouths shut!

18:53.194 --> 18:55.571
My name is Josuke Higashikata.

18:55.738 --> 18:58.240
Stand name, Shining Diamond.

18:58.408 --> 19:00.118
I might be limited to
close-range attacks,

19:00.201 --> 19:02.161
but I can assure you
my punching speed

19:02.203 --> 19:04.747
is a lot faster than
a nap-inducing 60km/h.

19:05.039 --> 19:07.416
I've never measured,

19:07.458 --> 19:10.586
but close up,
I can get up to about 300km/h.

19:10.628 --> 19:12.504
Hey, wait right there!

19:12.547 --> 19:15.967
M-My back's broken.

19:16.050 --> 19:18.260
I have fractured arms and legs,
I can't even roll over.

19:18.303 --> 19:19.762
I'm majorly hurt!

19:20.054 --> 19:23.807
You're gonna slap around a feeble,
bed-ridden hospital patient?

19:24.559 --> 19:29.059
All right, I was a jerk.
I'll free the guy in the tunnel.

19:29.272 --> 19:30.773
I think he's still alive.

19:30.857 --> 19:33.234
Though it wouldn't hurt
to give him some nutrients…

19:33.401 --> 19:34.819
S-So…

19:36.070 --> 19:39.490
You wouldn't beat up
a poor invalid…

19:39.574 --> 19:41.450
You wouldn't do something
so cowardly, would you?

19:41.534 --> 19:43.661
That certainly
wouldn't be very manly!

19:43.745 --> 19:45.663
Yeah! You coward!

19:45.913 --> 19:47.789
Yeah, suppose you're right…

19:47.957 --> 19:49.875
Knocking the shit out of
a poor injured victim

19:49.917 --> 19:51.793
would leave a bad taste
in my mouth.

19:51.836 --> 19:55.381
It's definitely not manly…
It's just not right.

19:55.423 --> 19:59.923
Right? Beating up a guy like me
will haunt your conscience forever.

20:01.220 --> 20:04.640
Which is why I already
made you all better.

20:04.932 --> 20:05.891
Huh?!

20:05.933 --> 20:06.642
Eh?

20:06.642 --> 20:07.768
See if you can move.

20:07.810 --> 20:09.061
You can, right?

20:09.145 --> 20:11.480
You're completely healed,
aren't you?

20:13.024 --> 20:15.484
You're right, I am…

20:16.152 --> 20:17.153
Right.

20:17.487 --> 20:20.573
By fixing you up real good,

20:20.948 --> 20:24.993
I avoid looking like
a coward, right?

20:32.126 --> 20:34.586
<i>Yuya Fungami's hospital stay—
extended</i>

20:34.962 --> 20:36.672
<i>If you so much as think about</i>

20:36.714 --> 20:39.174
<i>healing yourself with
Highway Go Go,</i>

20:39.217 --> 20:42.845
<i>I'll just rearrange your face
all over again, insisted Josuke.</i>

20:51.813 --> 20:54.398
I feel invigorated.

20:54.482 --> 20:56.734
I feel like I've put on
a fresh pair of undies

20:56.818 --> 21:00.029
in the wee hours of New Year's day.

21:00.988 --> 21:03.281
- Yu, babe!
- Yu, babe!

21:03.324 --> 21:06.327
<i>However, being nursedback
to health by a do ring fan girls</i>

21:06.369 --> 21:08.412
<i>isn't too shabby either.</i>

21:09.038 --> 21:10.372
<i>Meanwhile, Rohan…</i>

21:13.876 --> 21:16.628
Josuke Higashikata…

21:16.671 --> 21:19.048
U-Um, look, Rohan-sensei,

21:19.173 --> 21:21.550
I know a lot has happened
between the two of us…

21:21.634 --> 21:23.594
Why did you heal me?

21:24.011 --> 21:24.886
Huh?

21:24.971 --> 21:26.555
You should've minded
your own business.

21:26.597 --> 21:28.682
I would've rather
wasted away to nothing

21:28.724 --> 21:30.142
than have been saved
by the likes of you.

21:31.018 --> 21:32.936
I told you to run,

21:33.020 --> 21:35.439
but you still stepped right into
the enemy's trap.

21:35.523 --> 21:36.524
You're an ignoramus.

21:36.899 --> 21:37.983
Wha—

21:38.025 --> 21:40.944
By the way, you and I are even now.

21:41.112 --> 21:43.572
<i>Just when it seemed Rohan
was about to turn the page…</i>

21:44.782 --> 21:45.532
<i>On a different note…</i>

21:45.533 --> 21:49.453
<i>Koichi Hirose decided to
go on a walk with his dog.</i>

21:54.292 --> 21:56.961
HIGHWAY GO GO

22:19.192 --> 22:22.361
Ah, a British Shorthair.

22:23.154 --> 22:25.614
Where'd you come from,
little sweetie?

23:38.813 --> 23:42.024
EPISODE 30
CATS LOVE YOSHIKAGE KIRA
